{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1264","id":3989988382,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87t0mQe","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1264","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1264.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1264.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1264","number":1264,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[FA-CROP-HVY-03] Build VLM minimum-necessary crop proposal packets (#1247)","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1247. Parent #1243; depends on #1245 (FA-CROP-HVY-01) and #1246 (FA-CROP-HVY-02).\n\n## What\n\nBuilds **request-only** external-VLM crop proposal packets from the merged #1246 deterministic source-page render manifest and the 858-row precise crop source map. **No external VLM is called and no VLM output is fabricated** — this issue prepares packets only.\n\n## Inputs (merged on main)\n\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/figureasset-precise-crop-source-map.v1.json` (858 rows)\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/figureasset-source-page-renders.v1.json` (#1246 render manifest; each referenced render carries `output_sha256` + `render_status: rendered`, and the manifest hash is recorded in `source_artifacts`)\n\n## Outputs\n\n| Artifact | Purpose |\n| --- | --- |\n| `figureasset-vlm-crop-proposal-packets.v1.json` | 858 packets + packet schema + expected-output schema + minimum-necessary policy + wave plan + no-call readback |\n| `figureasset-vlm-crop-proposal-packets.wave-shard-manifest.v1.json` | Wave/shard partition (11 shards) |\n| `figureasset-vlm-crop-proposal-packets.examples.json` | One example packet per visual class + empty response template |\n| `figureasset-vlm-crop-proposal-packets.validator-result.json` | 10-check validator (status: pass) |\n| `figureasset-vlm-crop-proposal-packets.readback.md` | Counts + privacy/security no-call readback |\n| `scripts/method-map/build-figureasset-vlm-crop-proposal-packets.mjs` | Deterministic builder (`--write` / `--check`) |\n| `scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-vlm-crop-proposal-packets.test.js` | 4 tests |\n\n## Design\n\n- **Minimum-necessary:** each packet carries only packet id, row id, question/paper metadata, target visual description, source-page render reference(s), expected-output schema ref, and rights notes. Student/profile/session field keys are enumerated and enforced (validator scans every packet).\n- **Waves:** `wave-001` pilot (75 next-wave-priority packets, 3×25 shards) + `wave-002` bulk (783 packets, 8×100 shards). Deterministic ordering by priority rank then question key.\n- **Expected output is a contract only** — `vlm_output_status: \"not_generated\"`, no `crop_proposals`, no bbox coordinates in any packet.\n- **No-call proof:** a static builder audit confirms only offline node builtins are imported (`node:crypto/fs/path/url`), no network primitives, no disallowed modules; surfaced in `boundary.security_no_call_readback` and re-verified by the validator.\n\n## Verification\n\n```bash\nnode scripts/method-map/build-figureasset-vlm-crop-proposal-packets.mjs --check   # validation_status=pass, check_mode=pass\nnode --experimental-vm-modules node_modules/jest/bin/jest.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-vlm-crop-proposal-packets.test.js\n```\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","created_at":"2026-07-04T08:22:58Z","updated_at":"2026-07-04T10:42:25Z","closed_at":"2026-07-04T10:42:24Z","merged_at":"2026-07-04T10:42:24Z","merge_commit_sha":"bd5a0786eac8802abd8e4d2f60b2d6e772e6bdd5","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1264/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1264/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1264/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/56ec92217ab627449581d950582789e8a6dc407b","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1247","ref":"feat/issue-1247","sha":"56ec92217ab627449581d950582789e8a6dc407b","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samse